#: applications/luci-app-minidlna/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/minidlna.js:69
msgid ""
"Set this if you want to customize the name that shows up on your clients."
msgstr "Angi dette hvis du vil tilpasse navnet som vises på kundene dine."

#: applications/luci-app-minidlna/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/minidlna.js:88
msgid ""
"Set this if you would like to specify the directory where you want MiniDLNA "
"to store its database and album art cache."
msgstr ""
"Angi dette hvis du vil spesifisere katalogen der du vil at MiniDLNA skal "
"lagre databasen og albumgrafikkens cache."

#: applications/luci-app-minidlna/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/minidlna.js:94
msgid ""
"Set this to allow serving content outside the media root (via symlinks)."
msgstr ""
"Angi dette for å tillate visning av innhold utenfor mediaroten (via "
"symbolkoblinger)."

#: applications/luci-app-minidlna/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/minidlna.js:90
msgid ""
"Set this to enable inotify monitoring to discover new files automatically."
msgstr ""
"Angi dette for å aktivere inotify-overvåking for å oppdage nye filer "
"automatisk."

#: applications/luci-app-minidlna/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/minidlna.js:92
msgid ""
"Set this to enable support for streaming .jpg and .mp3 files to a TiVo "
"supporting HMO."
msgstr ""
"Angi dette for å aktivere støtte for streaming av .jpg- og .mp3-filer til en"
" TiVo-støttende HMO."

#: applications/luci-app-minidlna/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/minidlna.js:96
msgid ""
"Set this to strictly adhere to DLNA standards. This will allow server-side "
"downscaling of very large JPEG images, which may hurt JPEG serving "
"performance on (at least) Sony DLNA products."
msgstr ""
"Still inn denne til å følge DLNA-standarder. Dette vil tillate nedskalering "
"på serversiden av veldig store JPEG-bilder, noe som kan skade JPEG-"
"visningsytelsen på (minst) Sony DLNA-produkter."

#: applications/luci-app-minidlna/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/minidlna.js:78
msgid ""
"Set this to the directory you want scanned. If you want to restrict the "
"directory to a specific content type, you can prepend the type ('A' for "
"audio, 'V' for video, 'P' for images), followed by a comma, to the directory"
" (eg. A,/mnt/media/Music). Multiple directories can be specified."
msgstr ""
"Sett dette til katalogen du vil skannes. Hvis du vil begrense katalogen til "
"en bestemt innholdstype, kan du sette typen ('A' for lyd, 'V' for video, 'P'"
" for bilder), etterfulgt av et komma, til katalogen (f.eks. A "
",/mnt/media/Musikk). Flere kataloger kan spesifiseres."

#: applications/luci-app-minidlna/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/minidlna.js:112
msgid "Specify the path to the MiniSSDPd socket."
msgstr "Spesifiser banen til MiniSSDPd-kontakten."

